gq_(){return"K\xfcrek, thruster, barfiks \u2014 molas\u0131z \xfc\xe7 istasyon. A\u011f\u0131rl\u0131k bilerek hafif: \xf6l\xe7\xfclen \u015fey k\xfcrekten sonra devam edebilmen."},
